# 📥 Dataset Download Guide

This guide walks you through downloading the two datasets used in this
project: **TrashNet** and the **Kaggle "New Trash Classification Dataset."**

> 💡 Datasets are not included in this repository due to their size and
> licensing. You'll need to download them yourself using the steps below.

---

## 🌿 1. TrashNet :- https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/mr67c82zw7/1 

**What it adds:** 6 core waste categories — cardboard, glass, paper,
plastic, metal, and trash (2,527 images total).

**Download link (Kaggle):** https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/akshat103/e-waste-image-dataset
